   "source": [
    "### Program Explanation\n",
    "\n",
    "__len__() returns the number of students stored in the names list.\n",
    "\n",
    "When len(students) is used, Python automatically calls the __len__() method.\n",
    "\n",
    "The result is the total number of students."
   ]
  },
